    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n31679" root="غرض" body-key="g">
    
      4 
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">اغرضهُ</span></b>  <i>He made him to be vexed,</i> or <i>disquieted
by grief, and by distress of mind; to be grieved,
and distressed in mind: he made him to be disgusted; to turn away with disgust.</i> (S.) ＝   
    <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer1"> </span>-A2-  See
also 1, latter half, in two places. ＝   
    <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer1"> </span>-A3-  <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">اغرض النَّاقَةَ</span>:
see 1, last sentence. ＝   
    <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer1"> </span>-A4-  <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">اغرض</span> <i>He</i> (a man) <i>hit,</i> or
<i>attained, the</i> <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">غَرَض</span> [i. e. the <i>butt,</i> or <i>object of aim,</i>
&amp;c.]. (IKtt.)

